    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4164" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">astrictĭo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ads-</span></b> ), ōnis,
			f.
		astringo. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A power of contracting</i>, <i>astringency</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">herba gustūs amari cum adstrictione,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					27, 10, 59, § 83</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>The act of sharpening</i>, Cod. Th. 1, 4,
		3.</div>
